OL,3,ARock collapse kills two in Turkey's
OL,4,ACappadocia, local media reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least two people have been killed
OL,7,Fafter a rock formation collapsed at a
OL,8,Ftourist site in Turkey's historical
OL,9,Fregion of Cappadocia, local media is
OL,10,Freporting.
OL,12,FOne of the formations, known as "fairy
OL,13,Fchimneys", reportedly collapsed at the
OL,14,Fpopular Goreme Open Air Museum.
OL,16,FAmbulances and rescue teams have been
OL,17,Fdeployed to the area, and a search and
OL,18,Frescue operation is now under way.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
